<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:42:74">Administrative Office</h5>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:43:24"><span>The Salvation Army Youth Centers</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:44:54">1000 Center Place Norcross, GA 30093</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:45:88"><a href="tel:4044862962">404-486-2962</a>&nbsp;</span></p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:46:13"></div>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:48:22">
	The Salvation Army Youth Centers&nbsp;are managed by a professional staff of trained personnel with assistance from&nbsp;a volunteer Advisory Council. As members of The Salvation Army Metro Atlanta organization, the Centers&nbsp;are&nbsp;further monitored and administered by an Administrative Office and a Corporate Board of Directors.
</p>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:49:26"></div>
<hr data-zesty-id="design:design:horizontalrule:50:70">
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:51:81">
	The Salvation Army Youth Ministries&nbsp;are&nbsp;proud to be taking steps to become more environmentally sustainable.
</p>
